content.text:
请对以下 case 进行三维加权评分。

=== case_id ===
Case-19-photo-album-009

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
整个图吧，点一下进相册，能看天气，提醒我快没空间了

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "整个图吧，点一下进相册，能看天气，提醒我快没空间了",
  "size": "2x2",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToDeeplink",
      "args": {
        "bundleName": "com.huawei.hmos.photos",
        "abilityName": "com.huawei.hmos.photos.MainAbility",
        "uri": "album"
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModelSchema": {
    "data": {
      "weather": {
        "current": {
          "temperatureText": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "当前温度展示文本",
            "sampleValue": "28°C"
          },
          "condition": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "当前天气现象",
            "sampleValue": "多云"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ui": {
      "storageWarningText": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "相册空间不足提醒文案",
        "sampleValue": "空间快满"
      },
      "albumHint": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "整卡点击进入相册的短提示",
        "sampleValue": "点按进相册"
      }
    }
  },
  "assetCandidates": [
    {
      "src": "resources/base/media/partly_cloudy.png",
      "description": "云朵在前、太阳在后的彩色天气图标，适合在相册卡片中作为天气状态的视觉锚点。"
    }
  ]
}

=== 待评审 DSL (card.dsl.jsonl，共 3 行) ===
